  "source_code": "# cook your dish here\r\nt = int(input())\r\nfor _ in range(t):\r\n    n = int(input())\r\n    a = sorted(map(int, input().split()), reverse = True)\r\n    p = [0]\r\n    for x in a:p.append(p[-1]+x)\r\n    \r\n    def f(a,b):\r\n        z = 2*p[a]\r\n        y = p[a+2*b]\r\n        \r\n        return z + y + 3*p[3*n-2*a-b]\r\n    \r\n    b = n\r\n    ans = 0\r\n    for a in range(n+1):\r\n        b = min(b, n-a)\r\n        while b and f(a,b-1)>= f(a,b):\r\n            b -= 1 \r\n        ans = max(ans, f(a,b))\r\n    print(ans)",
